  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/image/tips_logo.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"17\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"200\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"594\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;<b><img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/w.gif\" width=\"30\">RONG(롱)</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"290\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"280\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/dungeon/wrong_map.gif\" width=\"320\"></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"300\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>던전설명 \n                                        :</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">미녹에서 \n                            북서쪽으로 한참을 올라가시다보면</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">롱던을 \n                            보실 수 있습니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">중간 \n                            부분에 다리를 건너서 가야만 하지만</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">3써클 \n                            텔레포트로 어느정도는 거리를</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">단축 \n                            시킬 수 있을 것이라 생각됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">참고로 \n                            롱던전 바로위에는 아이스던전으로</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">가는 \n                            입구가 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">-----------------------------------------------</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_1.gif\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/image/icon_2.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_3.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                                        : 던전이동지역</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(같은 모양의 아이콘끼리 \n                                        이동됩니다)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"9\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_4.gif\" width=\"13\"> \n                                        : 비밀문이나 잠김문</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_5.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                                        : 던전내 중요 지점</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(클릭 하시면 상세정보를 \n                                        보실 수 있습니다)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">----------------------------------------------</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" height=\"641\" width=\"594\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"499\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"200\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/dungeon/wrong_1.gif\" usemap=\"#ImageMap2\" width=\"200\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"242\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>던전입구 \n                                        1층</b></span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>주요 \n                                        몬스터 :</b></font></span><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902132239/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Lizard%20man.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>\n</b></font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902132239/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Juka%20Warrior.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Juka \n                                        Warrior(쥬카워리어)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902132239/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Juka%20Mage.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Juka \n                                        Mage(쥬카메이지)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902132239/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Juka%20Lord.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Juka \n                                        Lord(쥬카로드)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902132239/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Controller.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Controller(골렘조정자)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902132239/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Iron%20Golem.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Iron \n                                        Golem(아이언 골렘)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902132239/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Exodus%20Overseer.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Exodus \n                                        Overseer(엑소더스 오버시어)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">※ \n                                        좌,우 대칭적으로&nbsp;쥬카로드,쥬카메이지,</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">쥬카워리어가 \n                                        상주하고 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">좌측은 \n                                        골렘과 조정자 그리고 중앙에는 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">오버시어가 \n                                        있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">※ \n                                        던전 형태가 좁을수록 난이도가 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">더욱 높아집니다. \n                                        </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">※ \n                                        </span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/image/icon_2.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"11\"></span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">던전이동지역아이콘에는 \n                                        반짝이는 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">워프존이 있습니다. 들어가시면 \n                                        바로</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지하1층으로 \n                                        진입하게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16